      players: 'One player (solitaire). The game is played by a single player who turns cards from the stock and builds the four foundations or places cards on the four waste (tableau) piles.',
      deck: '52 cards. Remove one Ace, one 2, one 3, and one 4. Place them as the base of 4 Foundation piles.',
      equipment: '52 cards. Remove one Ace, one 2, one 3, and one 4. Place them as the base of 4 Foundation piles.',
      dealing: 'Remove one A, 2, 3, 4; place as base of four foundations. Rest form stock. Turn from stock to foundation or waste.',
